{"id":"n55429-2-5","stage":4,"title":"머금다 · (眼泪)噙着","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n55429-2-5-1","ko":"바람이 비를 잔뜩 머금고 있는 게 비가 올 것 같아.","zh":"风里好像带着好多雨，看来要下雨了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"바람이","meaning":"风","explanation":"바람：风；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"바람","audio":"/audio/9ec024bb0ceb6fd21e9a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"85627","senseId":"1","lemma":"바람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"바람이","audio":"/audio/406cc056290e155abc22.mp3"}},{"text":"비를","meaning":"雨","explanation":"비：雨；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"비","audio":"/audio/5e0d62698b44a4342d26.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36681","senseId":"1","lemma":"비","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"비를","audio":"/audio/084d01a8d7b542e3231f.mp3"}},{"text":"잔뜩","meaning":"满满地","explanation":"잔뜩：满满地","readings":[{"term":"잔뜩","audio":"/audio/f48d09fc20ac9971096e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69821","senseId":"1","lemma":"잔뜩","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잔뜩","audio":"/audio/f48d09fc20ac9971096e.mp3"}},{"text":"머금고","meaning":"(眼泪)噙着，含着","explanation":"머금다：(眼泪)噙着，含着；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"머금다","audio":"/audio/c6026e628daade70c3fb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"55429","senseId":"2","lemma":"머금다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"머금고","audio":"/audio/9d4850a753933ac24756.mp3"}},{"text":"있는","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있는","audio":"/audio/9714c770db7ebcb9f4f1.mp3"}},{"text":"게","meaning":"这件事、这种情况（것 + 이）","explanation":"게 是依存名词 것 和主格助词 이 的缩合，指前面修饰的事物、行为或情况，并把它作为主语；这里不是表示将来计划的 -ㄹ/을 것이다。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"게","audio":"/audio/c7150cec89b60925ae40.mp3"}},{"text":"비가","meaning":"雨","explanation":"비：雨；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"비","audio":"/audio/5e0d62698b44a4342d26.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36681","senseId":"1","lemma":"비","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"비가","audio":"/audio/34e7530f1cc9ef8588ee.mp3"}},{"text":"올","meaning":"下，来","explanation":"오다：下，来；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"17","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"올","audio":"/audio/d4e5ba0f9d89e82785b6.mp3"}},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","explanation":"것：表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"6","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}},{"text":"같아.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같아","audio":"/audio/3eb21a4d72c48bbf26ae.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"9ec024bb0ceb6fd2","term":"바람","zh":"风","audio":"/audio/9ec024bb0ceb6fd21e9a.mp3","entryId":"85627","definition":"气压的变化或者人类、机器等引起的空气的流动。","pronunciation":["바람"]},{"id":"5e0d62698b44a434","term":"비","zh":"雨","audio":"/audio/5e0d62698b44a4342d26.mp3","entryId":"36681","definition":"高空中形成云朵的水蒸气冷却凝聚后降落而下的水滴。","pronunciation":["비"]},{"id":"f48d09fc20ac9971","term":"잔뜩","zh":"满满地","audio":"/audio/f48d09fc20ac9971096e.mp3","entryId":"69821","definition":"充满得达到极限为止。","pronunciation":["잔뜩"]},{"id":"c6026e628daade70","term":"머금다","zh":"(眼泪)噙着，含着","audio":"/audio/c6026e628daade70c3fb.mp3","entryId":"55429","definition":"眼泪等液体带在里面不流下。","pronunciation":["머금따"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"前面所说的行为、状态或事情；表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"前面所说的行为、状态或事情","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"下，来","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"降雨雪或寒潮来临。","pronunciation":["오다"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/c9e791ed412e67cae005.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n55429-2-5-2","ko":"정말. 날씨도 흐리네.","zh":"真的呢，天气也好阴沉。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"정말.","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61173","senseId":"3","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}},{"text":"날씨도","meaning":"天气","explanation":"날씨：天气；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"날씨","audio":"/audio/fe655cf1d979cf3db76c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60630","senseId":"1","lemma":"날씨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"날씨도","audio":"/audio/0933cc8d3e4f29fc2621.mp3"}},{"text":"흐리네.","meaning":"阴沉，阴","explanation":"흐리다：阴沉，阴；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"흐리다","audio":"/audio/d48eac7caf4431460a48.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89184","senseId":"5","lemma":"흐리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"흐리네","audio":"/audio/a258989423e97cf09cab.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61173","definition":"用于强调自己所说的话。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"fe655cf1d979cf3d","term":"날씨","zh":"天气","audio":"/audio/fe655cf1d979cf3db76c.mp3","entryId":"60630","definition":"每天在气温或空气中出现的，如雨、云、风、雾等的状况。","pronunciation":["날씨"]},{"id":"d48eac7caf443146","term":"흐리다","zh":"阴沉，阴","audio":"/audio/d48eac7caf4431460a48.mp3","entryId":"89184","definition":"因为云或雾而天气不晴朗。","pronunciation":["흐리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/73014148b2dff196794d.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.042,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=55429","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"고급","day":144,"sequenceScore":2.8687,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["风里好像带着好多雨，看来要下雨了。","真的呢，天气也好阴沉。","你下个月不是要去美国吗？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["风里好像带着好多雨，看来要下雨了。","真的呢，天气也好阴沉。","你下个月不是要去美国吗？"],"answer":1}]}
